  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Calendar Features",
      "description": "Endpoints untuk calendar functionality - available slots, booked dates",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Available Time Slots",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/offline/balai/consultations/available-slots?balaiId={{balai_id}}&date={{test_date}}&interval=60",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "offline", "balai", "consultations", "available-slots"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "balaiId",
                  "value": "{{balai_id}}",
                  "description": "ID Balai (UUID)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "date",
                  "value": "{{test_date}}",
                  "description": "Tanggal yang ingin dicek (YYYY-MM-DD)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "interval",
                  "value": "60",
                  "description": "Interval slot dalam menit (optional, default: 60)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose:** Cek slot waktu yang masih available untuk booking\n\n**Auth:** Public (tidak perlu login)\n\n**Response:**\n- availableSlots: List waktu yang bisa di-book\n- bookedSlots: List waktu yang sudah terbooked\n- totalAvailableSlots: Jumlah slot tersedia\n- businessHours: Jam operasional balai\n\n**Use Case:** User pilih tanggal di calendar, frontend tampilkan time picker dengan slot available"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success - Available Slots",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/offline/balai/consultations/available-slots?balaiId={{balai_id}}&date=2025-11-15&interval=60"
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"date\": \"2025-11-15\",\n    \"balaiId\": \"7c5a3c5f-8a77-4d4e-9e0b-41b0b912c5a1\",\n    \"balaiName\": \"Balai Pelatihan Konstruksi Jakarta\",\n    \"businessHours\": {\n      \"start\": \"08:00:00\",\n      \"end\": \"17:00:00\",\n      \"slotIntervalMinutes\": 60\n    },\n    \"availableSlots\": [\n      \"08:00:00\",\n      \"09:00:00\",\n      \"11:00:00\",\n      \"14:00:00\"\n    ],\n    \"bookedSlots\": [\n      \"10:00:00\",\n      \"12:00:00\",\n      \"13:00:00\"\n    ],\n    \"totalAvailableSlots\": 4,\n    \"totalBookedSlots\": 3\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Booked Dates Calendar",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/offline/balai/consultations/booked-dates?balaiId={{balai_id}}&month=11&year=2025",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "offline", "balai", "consultations", "booked-dates"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "balaiId",
                  "value": "{{balai_id}}",
                  "description": "ID Balai (UUID)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "month",
                  "value": "11",
                  "description": "Bulan (1-12)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "year",
                  "value": "2025",
                  "description": "Tahun"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose:** Calendar month view - tampilkan tanggal yang ada booking\n\n**Auth:** Public\n\n**Response:**\n- dates: List tanggal dengan info booking\n- totalDaysWithBookings: Total hari yang ada booking\n- totalFullyBookedDays: Total hari yang fully booked\n- Per date: totalBookings, availableSlots, isFullyBooked, bookingPercentage\n\n**Use Case:** User buka calendar bulan November, frontend highlight tanggal yang ada booking"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success - Booked Dates",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/offline/balai/consultations/booked-dates?balaiId={{balai_id}}&month=11&year=2025"
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"balaiId\": \"7c5a3c5f-8a77-4d4e-9e0b-41b0b912c5a1\",\n    \"balaiName\": \"Balai Pelatihan Konstruksi Jakarta\",\n    \"month\": 11,\n    \"year\": 2025,\n    \"dates\": [\n      {\n        \"date\": \"2025-11-15\",\n        \"totalBookings\": 5,\n        \"availableSlots\": 4,\n        \"totalSlots\": 9,\n        \"isFullyBooked\": false,\n        \"bookingPercentage\": 55.56\n      },\n      {\n        \"date\": \"2025-11-16\",\n        \"totalBookings\": 9,\n        \"availableSlots\": 0,\n        \"totalSlots\": 9,\n        \"isFullyBooked\": true,\n        \"bookingPercentage\": 100.0\n      }\n    ],\n    \"totalDaysWithBookings\": 8,\n    \"totalFullyBookedDays\": 2\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. My Bookings",
      "description": "User consultation history - upcoming & past bookings",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get My Bookings (User History)",
